program	lend_accessor_local.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	differs
expect	error
build	refused	`lend tmp` is not rooted in the receiver: `tmp` is this accessor's own local or parameter, so the window would open onto storage that dies when the accessor resumes. A read through it would work and a WRITE would silently go nowhere. A `borrows` accessor lends storage the receiver already owns — lend a field, an element, or another place reached through `self` (an indirection the receiver holds counts: `if let buf = self.buffer { lend buf[i] }` lends the heap storage `self` points at). To hand back a computed value, return it from an ordinary method instead
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: `lend tmp` is not rooted in the receiver: `tmp` is this accessor's own local or parameter, so the window would open onto storage that dies when the accessor resumes. A read through it would work and a WRITE would silently go nowhere. A `borrows` accessor lends storage the receiver already owns — lend a field, an element, or another place reached through `self` (an indirection the receiver holds counts: `if let buf = self.buffer { lend buf[i] }` lends the heap storage `self` points at). To hand back a computed value, return it from an ordinary method instead"
log	"  --> examples/lend_accessor_local.saw:20:14"
log	"     |"
log	" 20 |         lend tmp"
log	"     |              ^"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
